{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3254","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3254","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3254\",\"parent_revision\":\"36b7333bb9b41f08d63643403200d9e8e379046ce18e8e05d3a250bf04c831aa\",\"root_revision\":\"36b7333bb9b41f08d63643403200d9e8e379046ce18e8e05d3a250bf04c831aa\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: 2026-08-27\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nplugins/python3-development/manifests/python3/language-manifest.yaml's `stage_skills.design` field lists `python3-design` as the agent to load via `mcp__plugin_dh_backlog__profile_load(agent_name='python3-design')` for SAM Phase 3 (Architecture Spec) dispatches. That name does not resolve \u2014 `profile_load` returned \\\"Agent 'python3-design' not found in any plugin,\\\" and `profile_list(plugin='python3-development')` confirms the plugin's actual 5 agents are `code-reviewer`, `python-cli-architect`, `python-cli-design-spec`, `python-pytest-architect`, `semantic-code-search` \u2014 no `python3-design` in any form.\\n\\nThe correct value is very likely `python-cli-design-spec` (bare) or `python3-development:python-cli-design-spec` (plugin-qualified) \u2014 it is the one agent in the plugin whose description matches the design-stage role exactly (\\\"Use when designing a Python CLI tool's architecture before implementation... Produces WHAT to build... python-cli-architect handles the HOW\\\"), and it is also the exact example value `plugins/development-harness/skills/add-new-feature/SKILL.md`'s own Phase 3 documentation cites: \\\"(Python example: python-engineering:python-cli-design-spec)\\\".\\n\\nObserved impact: the dispatched Phase 3 agent silently lost its specialist profile and proceeded without it (it had been told in advance this might happen and handled it gracefully), but any future dispatch relying on this manifest value for a Python feature would hit the same failure without that advance warning.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation \u2014 surfaced during SAM Phase 3 (architecture spec) of backlog item #3244; the dispatched agent's own profile_load call failed and it self-corrected by proceeding without the profile\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-27\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"149b7140ebb0cb67e5c16533992ce5c2ecf4d5822880e026d37c9c3fff512cd8\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRBanQQ\"}"}